# shared-skills/
# Place shared OpenClaw skill files here.
# This directory is mounted read-only into every client container.
# Skills here are available to all users but no user can modify them.
#
# Structure:
#   shared-skills/
#     my-skill.js     ← shared skill available to all users
#     another-skill/  ← skills can also be directories
#
# See OpenClaw docs for the skill format.
